{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - User - MFA - Okta Security Question Factor Reset",
	"Description": "A security question factor was reset. Security questions are the weakest factor Okta offers, and resetting one is a common step in a self-service recovery takeover because the answers are usually guessable or already breached.\n\nEvent types: user.mfa.factor.deactivate, user.mfa.factor.reset_all with an outcome reason naming the SECURITY_QUESTION factor\n\nReference(s):\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/api/openapi/okta-management/management/tag/SystemLog/",
